<h1 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Historica=
lFeedback&amp;Observations">Historical Feedback &amp; Observations</h1>
<p><br></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable">
  <colgroup>
   <col>
   <col>
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NCS-12218</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">User reported in NetRep she has access to th=
e A6 RR Codes and the CG RR codes, when using accounts she is only able to =
view the A6 RR codes.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Multiple tickets</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Issues with MFT and SFTP files&nbsp;</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<h1 style=3D"text-align: left;" id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Engagemen=
tFindings">Engagement Findings</h1>
<h2 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-CurrentAccessModel&amp;OperatingStruc=
ture">Current Access Model &amp; Operating Structure</h2>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-MultipleLogin/EnvironmentManagement">=
Multiple Login / Environment Management</h3>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Fiera/CGOVRelationship">Fiera / CGOV =
Relationship</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"48e803c9-2cc2-4d1e-b31b-1807418cb651">CGOV and Fiera merg=
ed in 2018.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"bea9c128-ac79-4647-8b32-faa75f033a35">Repapering and migr=
ating CGOV accounts to Fiera was not feasible, so the two environments cont=
inue to operate separately.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"aad9aab1-b594-4d65-bcc4-903027c5c129">CGOV maintains its =
own broker code; Fiera operates under ICPMC_FIER</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"93bdfbbc-9c65-4870-872b-bb27324d8ea4">As a result, staff =
supporting both businesses often require access to multiple environments an=
d IDs.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Long-TenuredUserBase">Long-Tenured Us=
er Base</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a024ec94-948e-44b8-8b45-8244cd55a1c7">Some employees have=
 been with the organization since 1995.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"182acf38-5cec-4a8b-a092-2b7054cea751">Users have experien=
ced multiple platform transitions:=20
  <ul>
   <li>ISM (no longer used)</li>
   <li>NetRep &amp; iMOST&nbsp;</li>
   <li>Legacy Compass</li>
   <li>New Compass</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-AccessbyRole">Access by Role</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"414fe927-6a0e-4341-a2dc-81ad5e675a99">Access is primarily=
 provided to Operations and Client Services teams.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"28b245d6-0d3e-4569-8247-23c116737963">Compliance users do=
 not have NBIN access due to business rules.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6df69f5d-0343-4102-9493-13621f58025e">Compass is used pri=
marily by:=20
  <ul>
   <li>Associates</li>
   <li>Operations staff</li>
   <li>Investment Counsellors who perform both administrative and advisory =
activities</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Multiple ID's</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e6c1e5f2-dcb5-4881-b26d-09e9a1cb012c">Some employees cont=
inue to rely on direct access to NetRep and iMOST and may require support a=
s transition efforts continue.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a334d664-97d7-45ee-8025-8616fea20ba7">Not all users have =
dual access; only those whose roles require it.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c0215671-04ed-4a74-b4e8-8794777ab190">Ideal future state =
would allow users to switch between environments more seamlessly.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"88ed01bf-73bc-409d-96ad-5a1d30ca0e33">Multiple IDs create=
 confusion for users regarding which credentials should be used for which e=
nvironment.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8ec33a2a-768e-4ee1-968b-7f1c541e26cf">A future state that=
 allows users to switch more seamlessly between environments would be benef=
icial.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Sub-AdvisoryBusinessModel">Sub-Adviso=
ry Business Model</h2>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-CurrentModel">Current Model</h3>
<p>Fiera provides sub-advisory services for firms such as:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0eadc36b-82c7-4745-97a6-2a46e38934c7">Kerr</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a2b4969c-4101-41c5-a882-6f3bacd7fea4">Patrimonica</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"be9efbe6-33e1-482a-aa30-9e82d7535a14">Guardian</li>
</ul>
<p>Required capabilities include:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8445d9c8-52af-4052-8488-aee113d26ecd">Account reconciliat=
ions</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"dd671a7d-8435-49e1-8bae-7c1436dce9b7">Reporting</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b0b629f6-ce23-4290-a4cd-305707f6d92e">Position views</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"db94ed7a-8883-470f-bba7-46ebfc1fb5ac">Transaction views</=
li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-AccessRequirements">Access Requiremen=
ts</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"52e6f4d5-36fc-4c74-97a5-c40cc2e52cfa">Access is needed by=
 only a small number of users (approximately 2=E2=80=933 operational users)=
.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"fec5b3bd-5bfc-4997-858f-b3e8666fdca5">View-only access wo=
uld satisfy many requirements.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"42643776-b83b-45d9-a93e-bbbaddf40623">Fiera prefers that =
sub-advisory environments remain separate for compliance purposes.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"70b0cab4-c93c-43e4-8666-81d77d82f176">Nancy (Patrimonica)=
 currently manages Fiera access on their side.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-KnownLimitation">Known Limitation</h3=
>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7e0ab473-6383-4c4a-b7af-0c19315ddc95">RR codes cannot cur=
rently be configured within sub-advisor fields.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-UserProvisioning&amp;Onboarding">User=
 Provisioning &amp; Onboarding</h2>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-CurrentProcess">Current Process</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"30bd9e77-6b6d-43db-b5a6-9dd6b9c6cdec">Nadra manages all N=
BIN user setups</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e090dc71-bb9c-43a8-8e03-464b151bcd93">Uses OneNote-based =
template is used to manage onboarding new users.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"aa6025f4-4436-41a9-adec-8248edd22426">Nadra can provision=
 R2 access for CGOV users using Super Steward functionality.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c9898289-dee5-452f-a6b6-a610aba4fbf9">Typical new user se=
tup timelines:=20
  <ul>
   <li>Fastest: 2=E2=80=933 days</li>
   <li>Can take up to 2 weeks</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-PainPoints">Pain Points</h3>
<h4 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-SAASLA">SAA SLA</h4>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f3eae733-533e-474e-be30-bb3a1bbbd058">Largest concern is =
inconsistent turnaround times.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"5297ac91-0327-4adb-853c-7cdde28be2f9">New employee reques=
ts typically cannot be submitted until one day before onboarding because th=
e temporary Secured Zone passwords expire after three business days.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"42d3908f-926b-4ab5-880f-b0d73a83a38b">SLA delays negative=
ly impact onboarding and training plans.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e7e339f8-d081-4b48-b7b4-796d51bd2985">Orientation often i=
ncludes Compass training, but users may not yet have access.</li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-MultipleRequestProcesses">Multiple Re=
quest Processes</h4>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7e90668e-c225-4944-a31d-b9084468d653">Different setup pro=
cesses exist for:=20
  <ul>
   <li>CGOV (R2 Direct + UAF)</li>
   <li>Fiera (myRequest)</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4af4d9e2-742f-4832-90c0-32f4f470bb31">RR codes often requ=
ire manual copying and pasting.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"910c972d-7463-40fa-ad1d-9fe3c6b53cb5">Some requirements m=
ust be entered into comments because they cannot be selected in request for=
ms.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"55cad105-0674-4b46-8f4d-6aa5a389cd99">Adding CGOV RR code=
s requires separate handling.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a5b8f92f-85de-4cb9-bafe-62e646558adf">MyPortfolio+ access=
 often requires manual intervention.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"65e029f1-680c-4865-baf1-2a57b84661c7">Provisioning for CG=
OV only supports R2 directly; NR and SZ access require additional requests.=
</li>
</ul>
<h4 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-LimitedBenefitfromSelf-ServiceSetup">=
Limited Benefit from Self-Service Setup</h4>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8c7e3eb5-a2d8-447c-b3b4-ff3f054061b0">Nadra indicated the=
re is limited value in the current self-setup process within R2.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-FeaturesIdentifiedasImportant">Featur=
es Identified as Important</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0fcb1085-1096-48a9-b61a-adf514a8712d">Account memos avail=
able through NetRep.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f9976aaa-5cb5-41a5-988b-3a6963c89ea4">Access to account i=
nformation, tax slips, servicing, and data functions.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b1176a17-dca7-4b96-acdb-4e96a79294f1">Prefers to be able =
to elect user access options on the request form, similar to the unified ac=
cess form.&nbsp; Using the free form comment field to request access is tim=
e consuming and permissions can be overlooked.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-PlatformUsage">Platform Usage&nbsp;</=
h2>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-SecuredZone(SZ)">Secured Zone (SZ)</h=
3>
<p>Used for:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4857378e-c485-4a26-97ad-29e914ef210a">Servicing</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"917fc889-94b9-49ba-b259-11e29c2e1160">iMOST</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e2f4a765-be63-4c6c-a431-3ccebb74370b">MyPortfolio+ IA</li=
>
 <li data-uuid=3D"01e2a196-d994-45cf-b86a-55a6c760ae56">Account information=
</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"106cde17-fc67-4adf-9c01-eabffe9479d3">Statements</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0b776b4b-7984-4ed3-b7a8-6dc0c2171e53">Tax slips</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0ac61a5c-a355-431c-ad1a-95a937fb3a54">WebPanagon access</=
li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-MyPortfolio+IA">MyPortfolio+ IA</h3>
<p>Used for:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1dec907e-c5f5-41b2-a202-9a0da196668c">Account inquiries</=
li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d8c8c00b-0edd-44b6-a8f2-cc1f012fa538">Statements</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d73088d8-b406-4a2b-8b54-81b681c4b1dc">Tax slips</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-WebPanagon">WebPanagon</h3>
<p>Used primarily for:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d34610d3-e706-4a98-8365-4fd1261200ac">Tax reports</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"79a4ffd9-016d-42f9-b823-00ca5d3eb443">Historical reportin=
g needs</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-NetRep2.0">NetRep 2.0</h3>
<p>Current usage is limited but remains important for:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1fbb6fd2-d77a-4b7e-aa47-34b8d0b741c1">Account transfer me=
mos</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"b29faf8c-28ac-4bfc-bfe0-6737f63f5ee4">Occasional cheque r=
equests, for backup processing when other systems are unavailable</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"da46b3fe-a6aa-4dd1-a028-4283cf62dfd7">Webreports</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Trading">Trading</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"30668f89-8bfb-45c7-8cca-b14cae5995ba">Archer is the prima=
ry tool for trading activities.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f7de9ebd-16e2-4de9-8a09-c5ba715a218a">Most trading occurs=
 through file uploads rather than individual order entry.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"1729a27f-11fb-43a8-b8fd-eb4986c9331c">Limited NetRep trad=
ing occurs today.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a694becb-6286-47b9-84bc-12ca67033a33">Most activity consi=
sts of FundSERV transactions.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Other Platforms</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li>Croesus</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Other custodian</strong></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"bf675495-ceb2-4d42-9f80-86967fa0f2e4">RBC Investor Servic=
es</li>
</ul>
<p>.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-QuarterlyAccessAttestation&amp;Access=
Governance"><strong>Quarterly Access Attestation &amp; Access Governance</s=
trong></h2>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-CurrentProcess.1">Current Process</h3=
>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7ac032e2-f744-4a27-a1d0-f9dcacf34661">Nadra performs quar=
terly access attestations.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"5ecf7679-d16d-41f0-8ab9-a01dac0e4366">Reviews are heavily=
 based on her knowledge of employees and organizational changes.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a840dd73-c5a6-46aa-a621-74fda71b3b2e">Reviews focus on te=
rminated/offboarded employees.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"750b3006-7727-4345-a2be-7782096cc9de">Private Wealth user=
s all have Compass access.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Challenges">Challenges</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"cc01f089-1c6f-49d0-89f2-59f906561c77">Historical Fiera us=
ers created inconsistencies in prior attestation exercises.&nbsp; (Pre Comp=
ass users were never set up with R2)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7c8534c4-db7f-4796-9506-c1bfb4e39f35">Some access records=
 lingered and required two attestation cycles (quarters) to resolve.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"92cad6dd-f9ca-4229-962f-d12374ef8275">Offboarding request=
s do not always process correctly and can reappear in future attestation re=
ports.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"71762497-024e-4293-9286-b853747e0c72">Some occasional use=
rs remain directly provisioned in Secured Zone.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"dc4e9384-d623-4daf-9d59-2d0b14c6f5cf">Users without Compa=
ss IDs must be deactivated through the&nbsp;Unified Access Forms (UAF)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e3b94ed6-3270-42de-904c-f6fdd81e2b10">Some legacy users n=
ever had Compass IDs because one was not required for their role.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-RequestedImprovements">Requested Impr=
ovements</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"281731f2-5d76-44ac-ae0f-c09913c9a3ce">Consolidated attest=
ation files.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f9d58a7a-6a54-4fa0-aab7-10fd7bf74ca7">Consolidated user a=
ccess reporting.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"5f4ce180-63ce-45ab-a48c-c3a3bae2af9f">Easier visibility i=
nto all user access across environments.</li>
</ul>
<p><br></p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Reporting&amp;AccessReviews"><strong>=
Reporting &amp; Access Reviews</strong></h2>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-WebPanagon.1">WebPanagon</h3>
<p>Current challenges:</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"fa8ace86-88d2-4db2-a885-ad1c3b5048d5">Difficult to know w=
hat reports are available.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"589a7065-87ad-4af7-9c34-c5f7972bdea9">Users would like a =
simplified reporting experience.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-WebReports">Web Reports</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2ee51cb3-7ec4-4320-b7df-6db76a9a9026">Fiera will review w=
hether any WebReports need to be maintained or replicated.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f43d3022-f37a-4a9e-a864-e76b6abdbad7">Additional discussi=
on is required regarding reporting functionality that may not yet exist in =
Compass.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-TradingWorkflowQuestions"><strong>Tra=
ding Workflow Questions</strong></h2>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-OpenDiscussion">Open Discussion</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"21873bf7-dd9c-41f0-9f2f-8ef99da99978">NetRep used for tra=
ding occasionally</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9cc0d473-4f7f-4a8d-8ee4-f224c73d0fda">Majority of trading=
 activity is completed through trade uploads.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"053bcbcc-c8a7-4044-89ec-fa06cf40a2cb">FundSERV trades rep=
resent the majority of activity.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"ec911f83-fbdb-4e54-b711-e662ecbfb5b8">Nadra knows a stron=
g contact to provide additional insight into trading workflows and requirem=
ents. She will connect with her and let us know.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-NextSteps"><strong>Next Steps</strong=
></h1>
<h2 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-NBIN">NBIN</h2>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Access&amp;Provisioning">Access &amp;=
 Provisioning</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"59583b1f-779c-4fee-ad47-913714c6a253">Review provisioning=
 SLA challenges and identify opportunities to improve turnaround times.</li=
>
 <li data-uuid=3D"96e86d19-4f3c-4647-bacc-d6efdcbb49eb">Assess temporary pa=
ssword expiry constraints and onboarding impacts.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"62d5462b-1366-43ba-86b6-e860b63447c0">Review manual setup=
 requirements for:=20
  <ul>
   <li>CGOV RR codes</li>
   <li>MyPortfolio+ access</li>
   <li>Non-Registered (NR) access</li>
   <li>Secured Zone access</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"ad8e017f-74fd-42ce-98b2-d69c3e68b584">Assess whether requ=
est forms can better support provisioning needs without relying on manual c=
omments.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c7784cb0-e9cf-4e48-8053-025a0f46ba9e">Review RR code limi=
tations within sub-advisor environments.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-UserExperience&amp;PlatformStrategy">=
User Experience &amp; Platform Strategy</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7653a18f-7017-4fda-8410-04eaa626ee6e">Investigate opportu=
nities to simplify the multi-ID experience.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f7bdb4d2-995a-4189-95ff-f36a9f29ed07">Explore future capa=
bilities that could allow seamless switching between environments while mai=
ntaining appropriate compliance controls.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"953e0fc1-ad73-4e71-a8f5-829283c21ad5">Identify users that=
 continue to depend on NetRep and iMOST and assess transition support requi=
rements.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Reporting">Reporting</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"30c39d72-5dec-4269-ac47-b7d943d826bd">Review WebPanagon r=
eporting challenges.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c7afcbad-cd08-408f-8f47-b0a8c3d97321">Determine which Net=
Rep/WebReports capabilities remain business critical.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"6dc0bf60-0556-4668-bd83-88de8e36e454">Evaluate reporting =
gaps between NetRep and Compass.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Governance">Governance</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8d7f52af-c1ea-4d74-8217-3e88e9bb19f6">Explore consolidate=
d attestation reporting.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c26115bf-d016-425e-85b8-e20df4ba3876">Assess feasibility =
of consolidated user access reporting.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c99be9ea-ece0-46e8-8e72-d5dfc9499994">Keep Nadra informed=
 regarding Unified Access, Compass, attestation, and reporting enhancements=
.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Trading.1">Trading</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4fb57228-9a74-41a6-9e1e-7df4f9d25b67">Meet with trading r=
epresentatives to validate requirements.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9c2216ef-ac99-463c-8be6-d84b1852c734">Follow up with Mish=
a regarding trading workflows and operational needs.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Fiera">Fiera</h2>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Documentation">Documentation</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c76f3166-8f30-42d8-b868-29bd63319a54">Share the OneNote o=
nboarding and provisioning template.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Reporting.1">Reporting</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"83e0384a-39ed-461a-b4c5-a6f70731b548">Identify business-c=
ritical WebReports.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"dcf522ce-68f6-4ce1-9e95-92180743b6d2">Confirm reporting r=
equirements that must be maintained during future migrations.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"8d3610b0-cae7-4657-a735-89435a938c42">Provide feedback re=
garding gaps between current reporting tools and Compass.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-Trading.2">Trading</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"bdb25ce3-cce2-4fb7-bce2-08bfa580cce2">Validate workflows =
with the trading team.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d66b0b7c-9599-4386-93b0-7f0508484133">Confirm any NetRep-=
specific requirements.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"ca317fe0-8b15-47a1-a3c7-1221c90588b3">Connect NBIN with F=
iera trader for additional input, if helpful.</li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryFiera-OngoingCollaboration">Ongoing Collabo=
ration</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7bd0493b-432d-486e-9eaf-f68a8e7648ae">Continue providing =
